    daharness-pg + wrapper tests resolve source paths first and fall back
    to the rules-installed twins (/usr/bin/daharness-pg,
    /usr/bin/daharness-chroma, /usr/share/daharness/postgres/init) so
    those contracts stay REAL on the deb; debian/packaging-source
    integrity asserts skip with a lane-specific reason
    (test_chroma_sidecar.py); the tool-author lane skips when payloads/
    is unwritable; test_vendor_arming.py's inert-shim test now asserts
